 * frameN.yuv for PC-side comparison.  Goal: determine whether the
 * misalignment is at the SAME position every frame (a structural,
 * locatable bug) or a DIFFERENT position each frame (payload
 * timing/byte jitter).  Open each as 320x240 YUYV(YUY2); the app
